      "writtenOn": "2017-03-16T02:30:00Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Iterations over maps don\u0027t have a guaranteed order. The current version of soong_zip at least produces repeatable zip files since it iterates over all the list args in order, then all the file args in order. Ideally we\u0027d iterate over each arg\u0027s files in the order the were specified.\n\nSo for `-l a -f b -l c -f d`, right now we do $(a) $(c) b d, ideally it would be $(a) b $(c) d.",
